<h1>Question 1 &mdash; Student Identity Card</h1>
<h2>Output Screenshot</h2>
<p class="cap"><b>Figure 1: IDCard.html rendered in the browser (name, DOB, photo placeholder, department, mobile, email, address; Student ID shown in the footer).</b></p><p><img src="data:image/png;base64," style="width:460px;border:1px solid #999;"/></p>
<h2>Source Code</h2>
<p class="cap"><b>IDCard.html</b></p><pre>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;!--
=====================================================================
  Graded Assignment (Weeks 1-6) - Question 1
  Student Identity Card
  Student ID: STU2024001          &lt;-- replace with your real Student ID
=====================================================================
--&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;

&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot; /&gt;
